Cancel the rollout of shop/web to web:1.5: put it back on web:1.4, the last spec that finished rolling out; nodes already on the new spec roll back.
Touches 1 app on 2 nodes (node-a, node-b); replaces 3 instances.
Serves https://shop.example.com/ and the service web.shop.
Undo: `relish undo 17` puts web back on web:1.5, which starts its rollout again.
